# mark: RequestClient =========================================================================

## Requests::RequestClient (Libraries/LibRequests/RequestClient.h:25). (Filled by region p2d.) In
## Ladybird the IPC connection to the RequestServer process; here the RequestClient seam of DESIGN.md
## §7.1: the embedder makes a client whose vtable starts and stops requests in process (the engine's
## InProcessRequestClient serves file:, data: and http(s): on luce-std net and luce-tls) and installs
## it with ResourceLoader::initialize. A client lives in the C heap for the process; the requests it
## makes are cells of the heap it was made with.
pub struct RequestsRequestClient:
    pub var vtable: const RequestsRequestClientVTable*
    ## The heap the client's requests are cells of.
    pub var m_heap: gc.Heap*
    pub var on_retrieve_http_cookie: ak.Function1[web_url.Url, ak.String]
    pub var on_request_server_died: ak.Function0[unit]
    pub var m_next_request_id: u64  # C++ default: { 0 }

## What a client implementation provides: the IPC messages RequestClient sends to RequestServer.
pub struct RequestsRequestClientVTable:
    ## RequestServer's start_request: begin loading `request` (made by start_request, with its id) and answer
    ## whether it started. What the server receives is delivered to the request on the event loop, never
    ## during this call (the caller sets the request's callbacks after it).
    pub let start_request: func(RequestsRequestClient*, RequestsRequest*, const RequestsStartRequest*) -> bool
    ## RequestServer's stop_request: no more is delivered to `request`; answers whether it was active.
    pub let stop_request: func(RequestsRequestClient*, RequestsRequest*) -> bool
    ## RequestServer's ensure_connection: resolve the URL's host, or connect to it, ahead of a request.
    pub let ensure_connection: func(RequestsRequestClient*, web_url.Url, RequestServerCacheLevel) -> unit

## The arguments of RequestClient::start_request (Libraries/LibRequests/RequestClient.h:36), as the
## seam hands them to its implementation. (Added by region p2d.)
pub struct RequestsStartRequest:
    pub var method: ak.ByteString
    pub var url: web_url.Url
    pub var request_headers: const HttpHeaderList*?
    pub var request_body: const u8[]
    pub var cache_mode: HttpCacheMode
    pub var include_credentials: HttpIncludeCredentials
    pub var proxy: CoreProxyData

## RequestServer::CacheLevel (Services/RequestServer/CacheLevel.h): how far ensure_connection goes.
## (Added by region p2d.)
pub enum RequestServerCacheLevel as u8:
    resolve_only = 0
    create_connection = 1
